A||||1||RICK||Gauges
Z||000000||RICK||07-29-99||04:55 PM||||I'm thinking about reworking the dash and replacing all the guages in the dash with aftermarket gauges (spedo, tach, gas, temp...)  Do any of the factory gauges give any type of feed back to the computer or can I just compleatly remove the wiring and gauges and run new wiring for the aftermarket ones? 
Z||000001||batboy||07-29-99||06:02 PM||||Good luck trying to fit any aftermarket speedos and tachs into the factory instrument cluster. I tried using Auto Meter gauges, but they wouldn't fit. I got the specs from VDO but still no joy. Paul told me that he used VDO gauges, but made his own panel. An aftermarket ELECTRIC (not mechanical) speedo will work with the OEM speed sensor. Most electric temp and oil gauges use their own sender, but that shouldn't be hard to swap in. If you figure out a good combination, let us know.
